  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agri-food Legal and Regulatory Support Initiative for Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To accelerate the implementation and impact of reform, in full alignment with the Agriculture Development Strategy of the Republic of Uzbekistan for 2020-2030, the wider enabling environment governing the agri-food sector policy priorities of the Government of Uzbekistan, and in coherence with the EU&#xbf;s strategic priorities for the Central Asia region, including environmental protection, climate change and gender equality.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
